title: We go into resistance
subtitle: The Nazis took power and we have an obligation to fight against them
new-page: true
view-if: resistance_enabled = 1 and wels_seen = 1
on-arrival: Q.nazi_year = 0; Q.nazi_month = 0
max-visits: 1

<span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Hitler**</span> took power and we have to build a resistance against him.

- @unite_against_fascism: Unite with the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Nazis**</span>!
- @stay_alone: Only build a resistance with the <span style="color: #000000;">We</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">im</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ar</span> Parties.

@unite_against_fascism
unavailable-subtitle: [? if kpd_relation < 30: The <span style="color: #700000;">**Communists**</span> think we are too social fascist to be a good partner against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Nazis**</span>. ?]
choose-if: kpd_relation >= 30 
on-arrival: antifa = 1; resistance = 1

We found the Antifascist Action (Antifaschistische Aktion (<span style="color:#DD0000;">Ant</span><span style="color:#000000;">ifa</span>)) with the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> to fight against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Nazis**</span>.

@stay_alone 
on-arrival: resistance = 1

We don't want to cooperate with the radical <span style="color: #700000;">**Communists**</span> from the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>. [? if kpd_relation < 30: The <span style="color: #700000;">**Communists**</span> don't want to cooperate with us either. ?]